 know how to translate technical constraints into business value. I am a fast learner and a highly empathetic communicator who excels at bridging the engineering department with stakeholders. I am currently seeking a structured, enterprise-scale environment where cross-functional communication and systems thinking are core requirements."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] font-bold text-text-subtle mb-4","children":"EXPERIENCE"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"border-l-2 border-ink pl-5 space-y-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-black","children":"Web Developer / Software Engineer I"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] text-text-subtle font-bold","children":"Cloud Security Alliance · Jul 2021 – Oct 2025"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-[14px] text-text list-disc pl-4","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Image pipeline: ~2,000 assets, 40–70MB lighter pages"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"SCORM automation: 8-hour process → 20-minute run"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Promoted from Junior Web Developer"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-black","children":"B.S. Computer Science"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] text-text-subtle font-bold","children":"Western Washington University · 2022 · Minor in Mathematics"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] text-text-subtle mt-1","children":"Eagle Scout"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
